# wvkbd deskintl layout, redesigned for Ky:
#- no F-key row by default - the top row is the number row now; the
#   bottom-left key flips the whole keyboard to a special layer (Esc,
#   F-keys, Del, Ins/Home/End/arrows/PgUp/PgDn, Abc back);
#- no Cmp key (compose still works by pressing a letter and sliding to its
#   accented variant), no Caps key (see wvkbd-caps-shift.patch), no right
#   Alt/Ctrl/Shift; PAD (KEY_F13, niri-bound) sits bottom-right on both
#   layers; every row sums to the source layout width, 14.5 units.
